{
  "slug": "spoki",
  "name": "Spoki",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect your WhatsApp Business to Claude.\n\nSpoki lets you send messages, manage contacts, launch marketing campaigns, build automations, and track performance... all through natural conversation.\n\nYou can go from \"send a birthday coupon to my VIP list\" to done in seconds.\n\nNo dashboard switching, no manual exports. Just ask Claude.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 agents**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `analytics` (View Spoki analytics, reports, and account metrics), `create-automation` (Create a WhatsApp automation workflow in Spoki), `create-campaign` (Create and schedule a WhatsApp marketing campaign via Spoki), `manage-contacts` (Search, create, update, and manage contacts in Spoki), `send-message` (Send a WhatsApp message to a contact via Spoki)\n- **Agents** (2): `customer-support-setup` (Agent for setting up and managing customer support workflows in Spoki), `whatsapp-campaign-manager` (Specialized agent for planning and executing WhatsApp marketing campaigns through Spoki)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `spoki`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spoki@claude-community` from `Spoki-App/spoki-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
